{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feltopia is a cozy cinematic platformer celebrating the craft of felting and the art of stop-motion. You play as Sky, a felter in training, who has just received her grandma\u2019s special needle. Set in a fully wooly world, where objects can be felted and manipulated, light puzzles will guide you through whimsical landscapes, on a quest to felt the world back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The future of Feltopia depends on you....</strong> <br>   <br>  <strong>WARNING: Playing FELTOPIA may result in fuzzy feelings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br>   </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3159860?t=1755638330","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755638330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/83f28967b9b0980183a3a74372a2066e03547252/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755638330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/83f28967b9b0980183a3a74372a2066e03547252/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755638330","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feltopia is a cozy cinematic platformer celebrating the craft of felting and the art of stop-motion. You play as Sky, a felter in training, who has just received her grandma\u2019s special needle. Set in a fully wooly world, where objects can be felted and manipulated, light puzzles will guide you through whimsical landscapes, on a quest to felt the world back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The future of Feltopia depends on you....</strong> <br>   <br>  <strong>WARNING: Playing FELTOPIA may result in fuzz